        "original_id": "723557e9-2152-5c66-8ec1-87c500897638",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Juan Carlos Onetti, Richard Llewellyn\n- Works: Nuit de chien, Para esta noche\n- Roles: Novelists, short story authors\n- Places: Montevideo, Madrid\n\nFacts:\n- Richard Llewellyn, born Richard Dafydd Vivian Llewellyn Lloyd, was born on 8 December 1906 and was a British novelist.\n- Juan Carlos Onetti Borges was born on 1 July 1909 in Montevideo and was a Uruguayan novelist and author of short stories.\n- Nuit de chien is based on the novel Para esta noche by Juan Carlos Onetti.\n- Richard Llewellyn died on 30 November 1983.\n- Juan Carlos Onetti Borges died on 30 May 1994 in Madrid.",
